  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT PARTLY STALE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096. Reproduces on the 2026-11-02 fixture: `path(\"login/\", LoginView.as_view())` gives usage_context symbol_ref `python:urls.py:19-20:LoginView:class` (nested `Outer.LoginView`); dispatches_to goes to `urls.py:9-10` at 0.5 with disambiguation_fallback. Two more shapes show the same clobber: a function-local `class LoginView` (Django `path`) and a function-local `class Item` (flask-restful `api.add_resource`). Writer: py.py:3579, unconditional for every ClassDef; nested functions are not registered (py.py:3918-3925). Reader sites today: 1519/1532/1537 (Django), 1894/1955/1969 (Flask), 2119 (Starlette). Volume on real repositories not measured. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-hahud.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # 178b
