  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. Re-ran the three review shapes: Outer.LoginView beside a top-level LoginView, a function-local class LoginView (Django path), and a function-local class Item (flask-restful add_resource): each UsageContext symbol_ref and dispatches_to now names the class the source names. The registry keys a declaration by its full scope chain; a bare name resolves lexically; a handler the registering file does not declare is resolved through that file's imports. pretix src/pretix: 0 declared ids gone, 29,223 of 29,223 symbols keep their stable id by position; 19 symbol_refs changed, 14 route edges retargeted (13 read in source), 504 route edges go from 0.5 flagged to 0.9. The route-handler linker fix that this needed (candidates of the route's host language, total order) has no item of its own: the Django route ^locale/set$ bound a JavaScript class in vendored pdf.js in some runs, and binds the Python view in both seeds measured now."  # d839
